OL,3,GNEWSAMP fears Poundland sites could end
OL,4,Aup as housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Coventry MP has expressed concern
OL,7,Fthat if Poundland stores close, their
OL,8,Flarge sites could be sold for housing.
OL,10,FA second buyer, London-based Xyra
OL,11,FGroup, has made a rescue bid for the
OL,12,Fdiscount retailer as it teeters on the
OL,13,Fbrink of collapse, with thousands of
OL,14,Fjobs at risk.
OL,16,FResponding to questions on BBC CWR's
OL,17,FHot Seat, Labour MP for Coventry East
OL,18,FMary Creagh said she was concerned if
OL,19,Fstores closed, "we lose that anchor
OL,20,Ftenant which drives" footfall for
OL,21,Fneighbouring shops.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
