OL,3,GNEWSAMP fears Poundland sites could end
OL,4,Aup as housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe politician, who spoke on the full
OL,7,Finterview that you can hear here,
OL,8,Fconfirmed there were three Poundland
OL,9,Fstores in the city. US-based owners
OL,10,FGordon Brothers said the business
OL,11,F"remains challenged and vulnerable".
